{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your own goblin shop. Craft unique weapons with minigames and negotiate their price! Hire workers to help you run the business! Become the richest merchant in the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>goblin</strong> who has finally decided to open your own weapons shop:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and decorate</strong> your shop tile by tile!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft weapons and buildings through mini-games</strong>! Each weapon will have a value based on its rarity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haggle with every customer</strong> and make a fortune! (As a true goblin)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire explorers and send them on missions</strong> around the world. After a few days, they will return with valuable <strong>resources and new recipes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire crafters</strong> to build for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insult</strong> your customers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to grow from a small workshop to the most famous armory in the land?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039680?t=1774276554","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039680?t=1774276554","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039680/30ac144f98ae4ffdba5f5d1dcbd0b9a7687219c2/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774276554","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039680/30ac144f98ae4ffdba5f5d1dcbd0b9a7687219c2/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774276554","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custo